### Obtener información de una asignación de ruta — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getAssignmentInformation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getAssignmentInformation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345
}

### RouteAssignmentId inválido (0) → 400 (requerido y mayor que 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getAssignmentInformation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 0
}

### RouteAssignmentId inexistente → 400 (no encontrada o sin acceso)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getAssignmentInformation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 999999999
}
